From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 06:27:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/20] plugin_api: launch Host API 3 plugins with the surface
 on fd 3

The launcher starts every plugin with only the control socket and a fixed
environment, and plugins have no place to keep state across launches.

For a version 3 plugin, pass the surface memfd as fd 3 (AERA_SURFACE_FD=3),
--aera-host-api=3 and AERA_HOST_API=3, and AERA_PLUGIN_DATA, a private
directory that survives plugin updates (/sdcard/AERA/plugin-data/<id>, or
/tmp/aera/plugin-data/<id> while storage is not mounted). Version 2 plugins
start exactly as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J6XhHxrkhAcXmkzHMeCnVz
